{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9b4125b8-6ed6-8424-8fca-ea5ce39a4c30",
  "created_at": "2026-02-19T10:58:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diane Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:57:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:57:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. I'm calling about the catch basin on my corner. It's been clogged up with leaves for, oh, about two weeks now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:57:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, and where's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:57:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at thirty-seven Rhode Island Avenue. Up on the Hill. The basin is right at the corner by my place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:57:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty-seven Rhode Island Avenue, got it. Is it flooding with the rain, or what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:57:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no rain. It's been dry. That's what's so aggravating. There's just a big puddle sitting there and it never drains. Never. I have to walk around it to get to the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:57:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ugh, I bet. Is the water over the whole road or just at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:57:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the curb, but it spreads out. And I'll tell you, it was not this bad last winter. Somebody must have cleaned it then. Nobody has touched it this year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:57:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll put in a request for a crew to check that basin and clear it. Can I get a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:58:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's four... zero... one. [pause] Five... five... five. [pause] Zero... one... nine... zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:58:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-zero. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:58:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because I'm trying to get on with things. I've started throwing pottery on a wheel, and I carry my buckets of clay water out and I'm tired of stepping through that mess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:58:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good for you on the pottery. Let's get that puddle gone. Is there anything else on the corner, like a second drain nearby?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:58:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, just the one. The one that's full of leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:58:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, it's logged. They'll look at it as soon as they can get out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:58:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thank you, dear. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
